[TITLE]
Malformed fixture — commit 82fc82b (feat(load): async model load) coverage.

An unrecognized section header or a garbled numeric field is NOT fatal in
this engine (unknown sections are skipped with a warning; unparsable
numeric tokens fall back to a default) — neither reliably reaches
swmm_engine_open()'s error path. [DWF] naming a node that is never defined
anywhere else in the model DOES fail reliably: it parses fine at the raw
section level, then fails during cross-reference resolution with a real
ERR_NAME diagnostic ("undefined object GHOST."), exercising the
swmm_get_last_error_msg() path SWMMModelLayer::openEngineForPath() prefers
over the generic swmm_error_message(rc) fallback (which for this same
return code previously read "Out of memory" — the regression the code
comment there documents).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS       CFS
INFILTRATION     HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING     DYNWAVE
START_DATE       01/01/2026
START_TIME       00:00:00
END_DATE         01/01/2026
END_TIME         01:00:00

[DWF]
;;Node           Constituent      Baseline
GHOST            FLOW             1.0
